Fork notice
===========

HerdrAppBar is a fork of HerdrBar. bigbug16 wrote it as herdr-topbar
(https://github.com/bigbug16/herdr-topbar), and Marcel Panse continued it as
herdr-osx-menubar (https://github.com/marcelpanse/herdr-osx-menubar); this fork
starts from that repository's commit 9140205. It is adapted to the herdr-app
desktop app: it reads herdr-app through `herdr-app ls` and `hc events`, and the
herdr TUI through its socket, and lists the agents of both in one panel.
